+- **Category:** text-to-image, local-first, prompting
+- **Best for:** fast room concept generation with minimal prompt tuning
+
+---
+
+#### [Diffusers](https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers)
+> **Description:** Diffusers is the underlying library many image-generation apps depend on, and its README presents it as a modular toolbox for pretrained diffusion models across images, audio, and more. Interior-design teams that want to build custom pipelines, automate style studies, or integrate image-to-image and inpainting into internal tools will find it more flexible than packaged UIs. The README emphasizes usability, customizability, and large checkpoint support on the Hugging Face ecosystem. GitHub currently lists last commit `2026-03-31`, `33.2k` stars, primary language `Python`, license `Apache-2.0`.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/huggingface/diffusers](https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers)
