+#### [ControlNet](https://github.com/lllyasviel/ControlNet)
+> **Description:** ControlNet is one of the most practically useful repos for design visualization because it lets diffusion models follow structural guidance such as edges, depth, scribbles, normals, and poses. Its README centers on controlled generation and includes demos like canny-to-image and depth-to-image, which map directly to room redesign use cases where layout preservation matters. Designers can keep the architecture of a space while changing finishes, furniture, lighting, or decor direction. GitHub metadata: last commit `2023-09-09`, `33.8k` stars, primary language `Python`, license `Apache-2.0`.
+
