+> **Description:** IOPaint is an inpainting-focused project built to remove unwanted objects, defects, or people and to erase or replace content with diffusion-backed editing. That makes it directly useful for interior designers cleaning up listing photos, removing clutter, testing empty-room staging, or replacing decor elements without moving into a full generative workflow. The README is straightforward about object removal and replacement, and the app is much more task-specific than a general diffusion UI. GitHub shows last commit `2025-04-29`, `22.9k` stars, primary language `Python`, license `Apache-2.0`.
