+
+> Best AI tools for interior designers in 2026 are increasingly open source, local-first, and GitHub-native. This list focuses only on public GitHub repositories that help with room concept renders, inpainting, object removal, segmentation, depth estimation, and 3D reconstruction workflows relevant to interior design teams.
