+#### [InvokeAI](https://github.com/invoke-ai/InvokeAI)
+> **Description:** Invoke positions itself as professional creative AI tooling for visual media, with a locally hosted web UI, unified canvas, and node workflows. That combination is highly relevant to interior designers who need image generation plus targeted inpainting, outpainting, and iterative refinement over sketches, renders, or real room photos. The README highlights boards, galleries, workflows, and a polished user experience rather than only raw model access, which makes it one of the more production-ready local options on GitHub. GitHub metadata: last commit `2026-03-15`, `26.9k` stars, primary language `TypeScript`, license `Apache-2.0`.
