+> **Description:** AUTOMATIC1111’s web UI remains one of the broadest local front ends for Stable Diffusion, with mature support for checkpoints, extensions, inpainting, upscaling, ControlNet integrations, and style experimentation. For interior design work, it is useful when you want maximum extension availability, custom workflows, and a large community knowledge base around photoreal room renders and furniture restyling. Its README frames the project as a browser interface built on Gradio and supported across multiple hardware setups. GitHub shows the project is still widely used even with slower recent development: last commit `2024-07-27`, `162k` stars, primary language `Python`, license `AGPL-3.0`.
